WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.310 --> 00:00:10.490
In 1913, Hitler, Stalin, Trotsky, Tito and
Freud, all lived within a few miles of each

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:24.220
other in Vienna, with some of them being regulars
at the same coffeehouses.

00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:30.019
The penalty for adultery in ancient Greece
involved hammering a radish into the adulterer's

00:00:30.019 --> 00:00:32.590
bottom with a mallet.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.820
Radishes were a lot longer and pointier in
those days.

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:44.370
By the age of 18, the average American child
will have seen 200,000 murders on television.

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:51.070
In 1672 an angry mob of Dutchmen killed and
ate their prime minister.

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:56.220
McDonald's is one of the largest owners of
real estate in the world and it earns the

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:02.370
majority of its profits from collecting rent,
not from selling food.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:08.570
Inuits use refrigerators to stop their food
from freezing.

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:17.689
In 2008, Usain Bolt set the world record for
the 100 metres with one shoelace undone.

00:01:17.689 --> 00:01:18.689
J.K.

00:01:18.689 --> 00:01:24.350
Rowling, author of the Harry Potter series,
is the first person to become a billionaire

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.920
by writing books.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:35.810
Antarctic islands include Disappointment Island,
Fabulous Island, Desolation Island, Monumental

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:44.090
Island, Inexpressible Island, Shag Island,
Circumcision Island and Shoe Island.

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:51.829
Iceland was once called 'Butterland' because
the grass was so rich it seemed to drip butter.

00:01:51.829 --> 00:01:59.810
Since 1700, new beetle species have been discovered
at the rate of one every six hours.

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:07.189
When trying out a new pen, 97% of people write
their own name.

00:02:07.189 --> 00:02:13.410
A trained typist's fingers cover about 16
miles a day.

00:02:13.410 --> 00:02:20.189
20% of all road accidents in Sweden involve
an elk.

00:02:20.189 --> 00:02:24.909
Every US president with a beard has been Republican.

00:02:24.909 --> 00:02:36.540
90% of everything written in English uses
just 1,000 words.

